@* ── Blazor component syntax ──
   (Razor Pages / MVC views and Blazor components use the same Razor language; a real file uses one flavour,
   both are shown here so every directive and construct is highlighted) *@
@page "/counter"
@page "/counter/{start:int}"
@rendermode @(new InteractiveServerRenderMode(prerender: false))
